IMPERIAL OFFICE REPORT

  Into thy heroic dreams cometh an apparition heaven-sent, to speak to thee of
thy progress in thy ambitions for Imperial Office.  It is not for mortal Kings
to know who rivals them for high offices, but the Divine One will allow you to
know thy place in the standings, and how thee compares to thy fiercest foreign
rival for each office (shown under "Riv%" as a percentage: your points divided
by your rival's points, times 100.)

Imperial Office           Best Hope     Rank  Riv%   Second Hope   Rank  Riv%
World Emperor             Kahn             9    17   None
Esteemed High Chancellor  Hume             2    81   Kahn             4    72
Imperial Treasurer        Kahn             8    35   None
Imperial Grand Marshal    Kahn            10    30   None
Imperial Grand Admiral    Hume            42     5   Hawkins         42     5
Lord High Defender        Kahn             2    18   None
High Priest Palatine      Charious        13    47   Hume            19    35
Arch-Mage Palatine        Hume            12    41   Kahn            12    41
Warlock of the Pagan Gods Kahn             1  None   None
  The title of "Warlock of the Pagan Gods" is reserved for the most powerful 
of Pagan Kings.
  Kahn is the greatest conqueror among Pagan kings, earning Kahn the title 
of Warlock of the Pagan Gods.  His fame has even won the support of the 
League of Pagan Clerics.  The League will supply all your Pagan characters 
with charms which will add 10% to their chance to cast a White Magic spell.  
They will help Kahn in battle: when he is the supreme commander at a battle, 
one unit in the front line, chosen at random, will be blessed by the Clerics 
and become fanatical.

Praetorian Guard          142nd Legion     7    63   None


